  "scope": "Elias Morad provides a tested chef precedent for an oil-based vegan roti, a 30-minute first rest and at least 4 hours after balling. This home adaptation uses 52% hydration by weight and 15 g oil allocated to dough, coating, stretching and cooking, 5 + 4 + 4 + 2 g. The dhal uses Tony Tan's coconut-milk method and Morad's red lentils and tomato; tomato is added once the lentils soften. Exact weights match the checked-in Fineli and AFCD rows. Two rotis and two servings of dhal. Full measured oil retention is an upper estimate. No physical trial.",
